body: Implement hassio ws traces list --domain automation|script with optional item filter and bounded count/all output; hassio ws traces contexts with optional paired domain and item filter plus deterministic bounded rows; and hassio ws traces get with required domain item and run identifiers preserving the exact Core trace object. Validate inputs before WebSocket construction. Do not add breakpoint or debug mutation commands.
